# Deploy runtime data — the production compose (deploy/) stores the SurrealDB
# data, the runtime-installed Docling/PyTorch cache + ML models, and Caddy's
# TLS certs under deploy/. These are multi-GB and must NEVER be sent as build
# context or baked into the image by `COPY . /app`. Root-level patterns above
# don't match nested paths, so list them explicitly (+ globs for safety).
deploy/surreal_data
deploy/notebook_data
deploy/caddy_data
deploy/caddy_config
deploy/.env
**/surreal_data
**/notebook_data
**/caddy_data
**/caddy_config
**/.cache

# Documentation & CI (not needed in image)
docs
.github

# IDE and OS files
.vscode
.idea
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store